}","RespondToWebhook reads user-configured responseHeaders.entries and converts each header name/value pair into the headers object that later reaches setResponseHeaders(). This is the external workflow-configuration entry point for the whitespace Content-Type bypass: an attacker-controlled Content-Type value such as ""  text/html"" enters the webhook response chain here before the CSP sandbox decision is made.","{""code"":""		}"",""desc"":""webhook-helpers.ts 第 615 行是 streaming 分支代码块的结束边界，标志着 res 对象已被完整写入 runData.httpResponse 并将 didSendResponse 置为 true。此时响应对象携带的 content-type 值——包括任何首尾空白字符——已无条件进入后续处理流程，构成污染链路的起始入口；任何对该头部值的校验缺失均会在下游持续传播。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/webhooks/webhook-helpers.ts"",""line"":615}","{""code"":""			const headers = {} as IDataObject;
			if (options.responseHeaders) {
				for (const header of (options.responseHeaders as IDataObject).entries as IDataObject[]) {
					if (typeof header.name !== 'string') {
						header.name = header.name?.toString();
					}
					headers[header.name?.toLowerCase() as string] = header.value?.toString();
				}
			}"",""desc"":""RespondToWebhook reads user-configured responseHeaders.entries and converts each header name/value pair into the headers object that later reaches setResponseHeaders(). This is the external workflow-configuration entry point for the whitespace Content-Type bypass: an attacker-controlled Content-Type value such as ""  text/html"" enters the webhook response chain here before the CSP sandbox decision is made."",""file"":""packages/nodes-base/nodes/RespondToWebhook/RespondToWebhook.node.ts"",""line"":""393-401""}","Move or retain the node that best represents external input, workflow configuration, request handling, or parameter entry into the vulnerable chain."

column3:
}",setResponseHeaders() 在写入工作流指定响应头后读回 content-type，并用 isHtmlRenderedContentType() 的结果决定是否设置 Content-Security-Policy sandbox。带前导空白或包围空白的 text/html 会被检测函数误判为非 HTML，使 needsSandbox 为 false，CSP sandbox 分支被跳过；这里是漏洞真正成立的安全决策/绕过点。,"{""code"":""	const contentTypeLower = contentType.toLowerCase();"",""desc"":""isHtmlRenderedContentType() 在 html-sandbox.ts 第 20 行仅对传入的 contentType 字符串执行 toLowerCase() 转换，生成 contentTypeLower，随后通过 startsWith 判断是否为 HTML 类型。由于此处跳过了 .trim() 步骤，任何含首尾空白的值在大小写规范化后依然保留空白前缀，致使 startsWith('text/html') 比较结果为 false，是整条漏洞链路的根因操作。"",""file"":""packages/core/src/html-sandbox.ts"",""line"":20}","{""code"":""		const contentType = res.getHeader('content-type') as string | undefined;
		const needsSandbox = !contentType || isHtmlRenderedContentType(contentType);

		if (needsSandbox && !isWebhookHtmlSandboxingDisabled()) {
			res.setHeader('Content-Security-Policy', getWebhookSandboxCSP());
		}"",""desc"":""setResponseHeaders() 在写入工作流指定响应头后读回 content-type，并用 isHtmlRenderedContentType() 的结果决定是否设置 Content-Security-Policy sandbox。带前导空白或包围空白的 text/html 会被检测函数误判为非 HTML，使 needsSandbox 为 false，CSP sandbox 分支被跳过；这里是漏洞真正成立的安全决策/绕过点。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/webhooks/webhook-request-handler.ts"",""line"":""153-158""}","Point at the real execution, security decision, or bypass-enabling operation instead of a wrapper, static declaration, or defensive helper definition."

}",setResponseHeaders() 在写入工作流指定响应头后读回 content-type，并用 isHtmlRenderedContentType() 的结果决定是否设置 Content-Security-Policy sandbox。带前导空白或包围空白的 text/html 会被检测函数误判为非 HTML，使 needsSandbox 为 false，CSP sandbox 分支被跳过；这里是漏洞真正成立的安全决策/绕过点。,"[{""code"":""		}"",""desc"":""trace 链路的第 0 节点，以 webhook-helpers.ts 第 615 行的代码块闭合边界为锚点，代表 streaming 分支执行完毕后 runData 已持有 res 引用的起始状态。从此节点出发，调用栈向下游依次流经 setResponseHeaders() 与 isHtmlRenderedContentType()，是整条调用链的起始锚定点。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/webhooks/webhook-helpers.ts"",""line"":615},{""code"":""
		if (responseMode === 'streaming') {
			Container.get(Logger).debug(
				`Execution of workflow ""${workflow.name}"" from with ID ${executionId} is set to streaming`,
				{ executionId },
			);
			// TODO: Add check for streaming nodes here
			runData.httpResponse = res;
			runData.streamingEnabled = true;
			didSendResponse = true;"",""desc"":""trace 第 1 步，位于 webhook-helpers.ts 第 605–614 行的 streaming 分支体内：responseMode 为 'streaming' 时，runData.httpResponse 被直接赋值为 res，runData.streamingEnabled 置为 true，didSendResponse 标记设为已响应。随后调用栈下游的 setResponseHeaders() 将以此 res 对象为操作目标，对用户指定的 headers 进行写入与读回。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/webhooks/webhook-helpers.ts"",""line"":""605-614""},{""code"":""	private setResponseHeaders(res: express.Response, headers?: WebhookResponseHeaders) {
		if (headers) {
			for (const [name, value] of headers.entries()) {
				res.setHeader(name, value);
			}
		}

		const contentType = res.getHeader('content-type') as string | undefined;
		const needsSandbox = !contentType || isHtmlRenderedContentType(contentType);"",""desc"":""trace 第 2 步，setResponseHeaders() 位于 webhook-request-handler.ts 第 146–155 行，承接来自上游的 res 对象，将用户工作流指定的 headers 逐条通过 res.setHeader() 写入响应——含潜在首尾空白的 content-type 于此被设置。随后函数读回 content-type 头的当前值并调用 isHtmlRenderedContentType(contentType)，needsSandbox 的布尔结果决定是否追加 CSP sandbox 头，污染值由此传入检测函数。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/webhooks/webhook-request-handler.ts"",""line"":""146-155""},{""code"":""export const isHtmlRenderedContentType = (contentType: string) => {
	const contentTypeLower = contentType.toLowerCase();

	return (
		// The content-type can also contain a charset, e.g. ""text/html; charset=utf-8""
		contentTypeLower.startsWith('text/html') || contentTypeLower.startsWith('application/xhtml+xml')
	);"",""desc"":""trace 第 3 步也是调用链终点，isHtmlRenderedContentType() 函数体位于 html-sandbox.ts 第 19–25 行，接收由 setResponseHeaders() 传入的 contentType 字符串。函数仅调用 toLowerCase() 生成 contentTypeLower，随即对 'text/html' 与 'application/xhtml+xml' 做 startsWith 前缀匹配。由于缺少 trim() 预处理，含首尾空白的 contentType 在大小写转换后仍无法通过前缀匹配，函数返回 false，上游 needsSandbox 判定失效，CSP 保护头被跳过。"",""file"":""packages/core/src/html-sandbox.ts"",""line"":""19-25""}]","[{""code"":""			const headers = {} as IDataObject;
			if (options.responseHeaders) {
				for (const header of (options.responseHeaders as IDataObject).entries as IDataObject[]) {
					if (typeof header.name !== 'string') {
						header.name = header.name?.toString();
					}
					headers[header.name?.toLowerCase() as string] = header.value?.toString();
				}
			}"",""desc"":""RespondToWebhook reads user-configured responseHeaders.entries and converts each header name/value pair into the headers object that later reaches setResponseHeaders(). This is the external workflow-configuration entry point for the whitespace Content-Type bypass: an attacker-controlled Content-Type value such as ""  text/html"" enters the webhook response chain here before the CSP sandbox decision is made."",""file"":""packages/nodes-base/nodes/RespondToWebhook/RespondToWebhook.node.ts"",""line"":""393-401""},{""code"":""		}"",""desc"":""webhook-helpers.ts 第 615 行是 streaming 分支代码块的结束边界，标志着 res 对象已被完整写入 runData.httpResponse 并将 didSendResponse 置为 true。此时响应对象携带的 content-type 值——包括任何首尾空白字符——已无条件进入后续处理流程，构成污染链路的起始入口；任何对该头部值的校验缺失均会在下游持续传播。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/webhooks/webhook-helpers.ts"",""line"":615},{""code"":""	private setResponseHeaders(res: express.Response, headers?: WebhookResponseHeaders) {
		if (headers) {
			for (const [name, value] of headers.entries()) {
				res.setHeader(name, value);
			}
		}"",""desc"":""trace 第 2 步，setResponseHeaders() 遍历 WebhookResponseHeaders，并通过 res.setHeader(name, value) 写入 Express response。若工作流配置了带前导空白的 Content-Type: text/html，该污染值会在这里成为响应对象上的 content-type 头。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/webhooks/webhook-request-handler.ts"",""line"":""146-151""},{""code"":""export const isHtmlRenderedContentType = (contentType: string) => {
	const contentTypeLower = contentType.toLowerCase();

	return (
		// The content-type can also contain a charset, e.g. ""text/html; charset=utf-8""
		contentTypeLower.startsWith('text/html') || contentTypeLower.startsWith('application/xhtml+xml')
	);"",""desc"":""trace 第 3 步，isHtmlRenderedContentType() 仅对 contentType 执行 toLowerCase()，没有先 trim()。因此带前导空白或包围空白的 HTML Content-Type 无法通过 startsWith 检测，函数错误返回 false；补丁正是在这里加入 trim()。"",""file"":""packages/core/src/html-sandbox.ts"",""line"":""19-25""},{""code"":""		const contentType = res.getHeader('content-type') as string | undefined;
		const needsSandbox = !contentType || isHtmlRenderedContentType(contentType);

		if (needsSandbox && !isWebhookHtmlSandboxingDisabled()) {
			res.setHeader('Content-Security-Policy', getWebhookSandboxCSP());
		}"",""desc"":""setResponseHeaders() 在写入工作流指定响应头后读回 content-type，并用 isHtmlRenderedContentType() 的结果决定是否设置 Content-Security-Policy sandbox。带前导空白或包围空白的 text/html 会被检测函数误判为非 HTML，使 needsSandbox 为 false，CSP sandbox 分支被跳过；这里是漏洞真正成立的安全决策/绕过点。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/webhooks/webhook-request-handler.ts"",""line"":""153-158""}]",Keep only the important data-flow or control-flow nodes from the entry point to the critical operation.

