): NodeParameterValue | INodeParameters | NodeParameterValue[] | INodeParameters[] {",resolveSimpleParameterValue 接收工作流节点参数中的原始 parameterValue，并首先判断其是否为表达式。根据 GHSA-6cqr-8cfr-67f8 的影响条件，具备创建或修改 workflow 权限的用户可在节点参数中提交 crafted expression；因此该方法参数位置是用户可控表达式进入 n8n 表达式求值链路的外部可达入口。,"{""code"":""		data.extend = extend;"",""desc"":""The extend helper is assigned to the sandbox data context here, becoming callable from any user-supplied expression in this scope. This is the exploit chain's origin: extend is exposed with no functionName validation at this boundary, so an attacker may pass any string including 'constructor' as the function name, enabling the downstream path to the Function constructor."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":485}","{""code"":""	resolveSimpleParameterValue(
		parameterValue: NodeParameterValue,
		data: IWorkflowDataProxyData,
		returnObjectAsString = false,
	): NodeParameterValue | INodeParameters | NodeParameterValue[] | INodeParameters[] {"",""desc"":""resolveSimpleParameterValue 接收工作流节点参数中的原始 parameterValue，并首先判断其是否为表达式。根据 GHSA-6cqr-8cfr-67f8 的影响条件，具备创建或修改 workflow 权限的用户可在节点参数中提交 crafted expression；因此该方法参数位置是用户可控表达式进入 n8n 表达式求值链路的外部可达入口。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""451-455""}","Move or retain the node that best represents external input, workflow configuration, request handling, or parameter entry into the vulnerable chain."

