return foundFunction.function.apply(input, args);",当 findExtendedFunction 将 functionName 解析为 native 函数后，extend 在此处以用户可控的 args 调用该函数。漏洞版本未在进入 native 分支前拒绝 constructor 等危险属性名，因此攻击者可让 functionName 解析到 Function 构造器，并通过 args 传入函数体字符串；该 apply 调用完成对 Function 构造器的实际调用，是 extend 路径中由属性解析转入可执行代码构造的关键操作。,"{""code"":""		if (inputAny && functionName && typeof inputAny[functionName] === 'function') {
			// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-assignment
			return { type: 'native', function: inputAny[functionName] };"",""desc"":""After all typed dispatch branches fail to match, findExtendedFunction falls through to this native fallback and returns inputAny[functionName] with no property-name check. Supplying 'constructor' as functionName on a function input resolves to the Function constructor, which is then invoked with an attacker-controlled code string, completing the sandbox escape."",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/extensions/extend.ts"",""line"":""82-84""}","{""code"":""	if (foundFunction.type === 'native') {
		// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-return
		return foundFunction.function.apply(input, args);"",""desc"":""当 findExtendedFunction 将 functionName 解析为 native 函数后，extend 在此处以用户可控的 args 调用该函数。漏洞版本未在进入 native 分支前拒绝 constructor 等危险属性名，因此攻击者可让 functionName 解析到 Function 构造器，并通过 args 传入函数体字符串；该 apply 调用完成对 Function 构造器的实际调用，是 extend 路径中由属性解析转入可执行代码构造的关键操作。"",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/extensions/extend.ts"",""line"":""132-134""}","Point at the real execution, security decision, or bypass-enabling operation instead of a wrapper, static declaration, or defensive helper definition."

return foundFunction.function.apply(input, args);",native 分支对上一步解析出的函数执行 apply 调用。对于 constructor 载荷，该语句以攻击者控制的 args 调用 Function 构造器，形成可执行代码构造点；该节点与 critical_operation 对齐。,"[{""code"":""		// expression extensions
		data.extend = extend;
		data.extendOptional = extendOptional;

		Object.defineProperty(data, sanitizerName, {
			value: sanitizer,
			writable: false,
			configurable: false,
		});"",""desc"":""At this caller-side setup step, the expression engine places extend and extendOptional onto the sandbox data object. The sanitizer is protected via Object.defineProperty, but extend is a plain writable assignment with no functionName guard, establishing the root exposure that subsequently propagates through the runtime re-injection and reaches findExtendedFunction unchanged."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""484-492""},{""code"":""		const constructorValidation = new RegExp(/\.\s*constructor/gm);
		if (parameterValue.match(constructorValidation)) {
			throw new ExpressionError('Expression contains invalid constructor function call', {
				causeDetailed: 'Constructor override attempt is not allowed due to security concerns',
				runIndex: data.$thisRunIndex,
				itemIndex: data.$thisItemIndex,
			});
		}"",""desc"":""Downstream from the injection block, this pre-evaluation guard tests the raw expression string for a literal dot-constructor pattern. The extend-based attack bypasses it because passing 'constructor' as a string argument to extend() generates no dot-accessor syntax in the source; the regex never matches, the error is not raised, and execution continues to the runtime layer unimpeded."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""496-503""},{""code"":""export const ThisSanitizer: ASTBeforeHook = (ast, dataNode) => {"",""desc"":""ThisSanitizer is the AST before-hook that rewrites member expressions to neutralize dangerous this-binding. It operates on AST node types, not on the string values of function arguments, so an extend call with 'constructor' as functionName passes through without any rewrite. The unsafe argument is forwarded intact to the VM runtime, bypassing this defense layer entirely."",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression-sandboxing.ts"",""line"":137},{""code"":""	globalThis.__data.extend = extend;
	globalThis.__data.extendOptional = extendOptional;"",""desc"":""Inside the VM context, extend and extendOptional are re-injected onto globalThis.__data, mirroring the host-side setup from expression.ts. This ensures both callables remain reachable when user expressions execute within the isolated V8 environment. No validation is added at this re-injection point, so the unguarded functionName path to findExtendedFunction is fully preserved inside the sandbox."",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/runtime/reset.ts"",""line"":""167-168""},{""code"":""export function extend(input: unknown, functionName: string, args: unknown[]) {
	const foundFunction = findExtendedFunction(input, functionName);"",""desc"":""The exported extend function marks the caller-to-callee boundary where a user expression enters the dispatch logic. functionName arrives as an unconstrained plain string with no denylist check. The call immediately delegates to findExtendedFunction, which then traverses typed extension branches and, finding no match for 'constructor', falls through to the native property access path."",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/extensions/extend.ts"",""line"":""105-106""},{""code"":""		const inputAny: any = input;
		// This is likely a builtin we're implementing for another type
		// (e.g. toLocaleString). We'll return that instead
		if (inputAny && functionName && typeof inputAny[functionName] === 'function') {
			// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-assignment
			return { type: 'native', function: inputAny[functionName] };
		}"",""desc"":""This block is the final callee step of the call stack descent from user expression through extend to findExtendedFunction. After all typed branches fail, inputAny[functionName] is read without filtering. For functionName 'constructor' on a function value, this yields the Function constructor, returned upstream and then invoked with attacker-controlled arguments to execute arbitrary code."",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/extensions/extend.ts"",""line"":""79-85""}]","[{""code"":""	resolveSimpleParameterValue(
		parameterValue: NodeParameterValue,
		data: IWorkflowDataProxyData,
		returnObjectAsString = false,
	): NodeParameterValue | INodeParameters | NodeParameterValue[] | INodeParameters[] {"",""desc"":""用户在 workflow 节点参数中配置的 parameterValue 在此进入表达式解析流程；只有被识别为表达式的参数才会继续向下游沙箱求值链路传播。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""451-455""},{""code"":""		parameterValue = parameterValue.substr(1);"",""desc"":""确认 parameterValue 是表达式后，代码去掉前缀等号，使用户控制的表达式主体进入后续扩展语法转换、文本检查和 VM 求值流程。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":465},{""code"":""		const constructorValidation = new RegExp(/\.\s*constructor/gm);
		if (parameterValue.match(constructorValidation)) {
			throw new ExpressionError('Expression contains invalid constructor function call', {
				causeDetailed: 'Constructor override attempt is not allowed due to security concerns',
				runIndex: data.$thisRunIndex,
				itemIndex: data.$thisItemIndex,
			});
		}"",""desc"":""漏洞版本只在原始表达式文本上拦截显式的点号 constructor 访问。通过 extend 调用把 constructor 作为函数名参数传递时，源码中不需要出现 .constructor 形式，因而该正则检查不会阻断后续的 native 函数解析路径。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""496-503""},{""code"":""		const extendedExpression = extendSyntax(parameterValue);
		const returnValue = this.renderExpression(extendedExpression, data);"",""desc"":""表达式经 extendSyntax 转换后进入 renderExpression；扩展方法调用最终会以 extend(input, functionName, args) 形式进入运行时，攻击者控制的 functionName 和 args 因此继续向 VM 表达式引擎传播。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""506-507""},{""code"":""				const result = Expression.vmEvaluator.evaluate(expression, data, {
					timezone: this.timezone,
				});"",""desc"":""在 VM 表达式引擎启用时，renderExpression 将转换后的 expression 和 data 上下文交给 VM evaluator。该调用把宿主层参数求值流程切换到 isolated-vm 运行时，是后续 __data.extend 与 expression-runtime/extend.ts 生效的控制流入口。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""534-536""},{""code"":""			const result = this.config.bridge.execute(transformedCode, data, {
				timezone: options?.timezone,
			});"",""desc"":""ExpressionEvaluator 先将模板表达式转换为可执行 JavaScript，再调用 bridge.execute 在 isolate 中执行。攻击表达式中的 extend(...) 调用会随 transformedCode 一同进入 isolated-vm 上下文。"",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/evaluator/expression-evaluator.ts"",""line"":""36-38""},{""code"":""	globalThis.__data.extend = extend;
	globalThis.__data.extendOptional = extendOptional;"",""desc"":""resetDataProxies 在 isolate 内把 expression-runtime 的 extend/extendOptional 暴露到 __data，使 Tournament 对裸标识符 extend 的解析能够命中该 helper。漏洞版本在此仅完成暴露，没有对传入的 functionName 施加危险属性名约束。"",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/runtime/reset.ts"",""line"":""167-168""},{""code"":""export function extend(input: unknown, functionName: string, args: unknown[]) {
	const foundFunction = findExtendedFunction(input, functionName);"",""desc"":""运行时 extend 接收表达式传入的 input、functionName 和 args，并立即把 functionName 交给 findExtendedFunction 解析。此处是用户控制的函数名从表达式运行时进入扩展分发逻辑的调用边界。"",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/extensions/extend.ts"",""line"":""105-106""},{""code"":""		const inputAny: any = input;
		// This is likely a builtin we're implementing for another type
		// (e.g. toLocaleString). We'll return that instead
		if (inputAny && functionName && typeof inputAny[functionName] === 'function') {
			// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-assignment
			return { type: 'native', function: inputAny[functionName] };
		}"",""desc"":""当各类型扩展表均未匹配时，findExtendedFunction 会直接读取 inputAny[functionName] 并把可调用属性作为 native 函数返回。漏洞版本缺少 constructor、prototype、__proto__ 等危险属性名 denylist；若 input 是函数对象且 functionName 为 constructor，此处会返回 Function 构造器。"",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/extensions/extend.ts"",""line"":""79-85""},{""code"":""	if (foundFunction.type === 'native') {
		// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-return
		return foundFunction.function.apply(input, args);"",""desc"":""native 分支对上一步解析出的函数执行 apply 调用。对于 constructor 载荷，该语句以攻击者控制的 args 调用 Function 构造器，形成可执行代码构造点；该节点与 critical_operation 对齐。"",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/extensions/extend.ts"",""line"":""132-134""}]",Keep only the important data-flow or control-flow nodes from the entry point to the critical operation.

