});",wrappedCode 在 isolated-vm context 中同步执行。若表达式先覆写 this.__sanitize，再触发由 PrototypeSanitizer 保护的动态属性访问，后续 this.__sanitize(expr) 将调用攻击者替换后的恒等函数，从而绕过 constructor 等危险属性过滤。,"[{""code"":""	private renderExpression(expression: string, data: IWorkflowDataProxyData) {"",""desc"":""renderExpression 是调用链从宿主层进入沙箱的起始段，从外部 caller 接收 expression 字符串后调用 evaluate，将控制流传递至 VM 沙箱内部的 callee；随后 PrototypeSanitizer 的编译期 AST 变换以此次触发为前提，执行路径再向下游延伸至 reset.ts 中 __sanitize 的初始化赋值，构成整条防护链的入口环节。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":524},{""code"":""				path.replace(
					b.memberExpression(
						// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-argument, @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any
						node.object as any,
						// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-unsafe-argument
						b.callExpression(b.memberExpression(dataNode, sanitizerIdentifier), [
							// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any
							node.property as any,
						]),
						true,"",""desc"":""PrototypeSanitizer 的 path.replace 处于调用链中间段，承接 renderExpression 触发的 AST 编译阶段控制流：将计算成员表达式逐一改写为 obj[this.__sanitize(expr)] 调用形式，在编译期将运行时过滤点嵌入每处动态属性访问，并将防护责任传递至下游 reset.ts 的 __sanitize 槽位。随后执行路径进入运行时初始化，改写节点所绑定的槽位是否具备不可变约束，决定该层防护在运行期能否成立。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression-sandboxing.ts"",""line"":""493-502""},{""code"":""	globalThis.__data.__sanitize = __sanitize;"",""desc"":""reset.ts L46 位于调用链末段，承接 PrototypeSanitizer 编译期改写所预设的绑定点：以普通赋值将 __sanitize 写入 __data，未设置不可写属性描述符，形成可覆写的运行时过滤槽位。与 critical_operation 指向同一赋值行，在调用链中既是初始化收口，也是沙箱内表达式可触达的缺陷落点——一旦该槽位被替换为恒等函数，上游 PrototypeSanitizer 编译期插入的全部过滤调用随之失效。"",""file"":""packages/@n8n/expression-runtime/src/runtime/reset.ts"",""line"":46}]","[{""code"":""	@Post('/:workflowId/run')"",""desc"":""认证用户通过该 HTTP POST 端点触发已保存 workflow 的手动执行。载荷中的 crafted expression 通常已通过 workflow 创建或更新流程写入节点参数；本端点是该表达式从外部操作进入实际执行链路的触发入口。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/workflows/workflows.controller.ts"",""line"":513},{""code"":""		const result = await this.workflowExecutionService.executeManually(
			dbWorkflow,
			req.body,
			req.user,
			req.headers['push-ref'],
		);"",""desc"":""runManually 从数据库读取 workflow 后调用 executeManually，并把 dbWorkflow 作为 workflowData 传入执行服务。包含恶意表达式的节点参数由此从持久化 workflow 定义进入运行时执行管线。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/workflows/workflows.controller.ts"",""line"":""527-532""},{""code"":""	async executeManually(
		workflowData: IWorkflowBase,
		payload: WorkflowRequest.ManualRunPayload,
		user: User,
		pushRef?: string,
	): Promise<{ executionId: string } | { waitingForWebhook: boolean }> {"",""desc"":""WorkflowExecutionService.executeManually 接收控制器传入的 workflowData 与手动执行 payload，开始构造 workflow 执行上下文。该节点连接网络触发层与后续节点参数求值层。"",""file"":""packages/cli/src/workflows/workflow-execution.service.ts"",""line"":""104-109""},{""code"":""		return this.expression.resolveSimpleParameterValue(parameterValue, data, returnObjectAsString);"",""desc"":""WorkflowExpression 在节点执行期间发现参数值为表达式后，构造 workflow data proxy，并把原始 parameterValue 交给 Expression.resolveSimpleParameterValue。此处是已保存节点参数进入通用表达式求值实现的转接点。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/workflow-expression.ts"",""line"":66},{""code"":""	resolveSimpleParameterValue(
		parameterValue: NodeParameterValue,
		data: IWorkflowDataProxyData,
		returnObjectAsString = false,"",""desc"":""Expression.resolveSimpleParameterValue 接收节点参数中的用户可控 parameterValue，并在确认其为表达式后继续处理。该节点不是本条 entry point，以避免和 entry-00511 重复，但它是从 workflow 参数到 VM 求值链路的关键数据流节点。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""451-454""},{""code"":""		const extendedExpression = extendSyntax(parameterValue);
		const returnValue = this.renderExpression(extendedExpression, data);"",""desc"":""确认表达式后，代码先通过 extendSyntax 做表达式语法转换，再调用 renderExpression。对于 reset.ts 路径，后续 VM evaluator 会执行 Tournament AST hook，并把动态属性访问改写为依赖 __sanitize 的形式。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""506-507""},{""code"":""				const result = Expression.vmEvaluator.evaluate(expression, data, {
					timezone: this.timezone,
				});"",""desc"":""在 VM 表达式引擎启用时，renderExpression 将转换后的 expression 和 data 上下文交给 expression-runtime 的 VM evaluator，控制流从宿主层进入 isolated-vm 表达式运行时。"",""file"":""packages/workflow/src/expression.ts"",""line"":""534-536""},{""code"":""		const [transformedCode] = this.tournament.getExpressionCode(expression);
